{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50429","headline":"四一 · 王梵志","name":"四一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长幼同欢（一本作「钦」。\n）敬，称尊莫不尊。\n（一本作「遵」。\n）（「称尊」，斯四六六九、伯四○九四卷作「知尊」。\n「莫不遵」，斯四六六九作「莫不从」。\n）且能行礼乐，乡里自称人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}